design is not internally consistent: prior chunk feedback identifies gaps in temporary-file safety, save-reply generation correlation, and send-to-chat selection after changing the document to a textarea. The feedback is still unresolved in the checkpoint. The required visual rendering checks also remain incomplete, so this consistency review cannot pass.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/scratchpad-document-view-read-only-cannot-E2026111401ac1e4b/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/review-lld-01ac1e4b6a6c9c2f-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/scratchpad-document-view-read-only-cannot-E2026111401ac1e4b/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/vscode-plugin/src/chat/scratch-store.ts","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/vscode-plugin/src/chat/scratch-host.ts","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/vscode-plugin/src/panels/scratch-panels.ts","docs/standalone/scratchpad-document-view-read-only-cannot-E2026111401ac1e4b/S001/sequence-diagram.html (source inspected; rendering not verified)","docs/standalone/scratchpad-document-view-read-only-cannot-E2026111401ac1e4b/S001/ux-mock.html (source inspected; rendering not verified)"],"limitations":["The sequence diagram’s rendered appearance could not be verified; prior checkpoint feedback records that browser access was unavailable.","The UX mock’s rendered appearance could not be verified; prior checkpoint feedback records that browser access was unavailable."],"advice":["Resolve the checkpoint’s existing findings before implementation: `store-temp-safety` requires exclusive/no-follow temp-file creation and corresponding fake coverage; `save-reply-generation-contract` requires a consistent generation-correlated save/reply contract; `sequence-textarea-selection` requires textarea-compatible selection handling for send-to-chat.","The checkpoint also records tha